module jev_calibration_plan_application_observation_lsp

input status
input target_stage
input observation_digest
input reason

status INFORMATION for BOUND plan application evidence
status HINT for DEFERRED plan application evidence
status ERROR for UNKNOWN or missing observation evidence

field code
field severity

constraint inspection_only
constraint read_only
constraint no_edits
constraint no_command
constraint no_execution
constraint no_authorization